Hello Peter,



I recibe from Dhl the Lcd yestarday. And today we install them whit the 
following result:





1.- The Mazak Mazatrol Data Ray DR5614 LCD work fine in My Mazak (Mazatrol 
T32-2)





2.- The TOTOKU MDT1283B-1A display, Mazak system monitor.



* Only work in Mazatrol M32B.

* And  didn’t work (No Signal) on Mazak M Plus.



This two machines have install a TOTOKU  MDT123B-1A.



Could be a wire configuration problem?



Would you please help me to this can work on The Mazak MPlus





I Attach the pictures.



Sincerely,

Roberto Reyes F.

